/* &#9472;&#9472; Password form toggle &#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472; */
(function () {
  function initPasswordToggle(root) {
    var scope = root || document;
    var link = scope.querySelector('[data-password-toggle]');
    var wrap = scope.querySelector('[data-password-form]');
    if (!link || !wrap || link.getAttribute('data-pw-bound') === '1') return;
    link.setAttribute('data-pw-bound', '1');
    function openForm() {
      wrap.classList.add('is-open');
      link.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'true');
      var i = wrap.querySelector('input[type="password"]');
      if (i) i.focus();
    }
    link.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
    link.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
      e.preventDefault();
      if (wrap.classList.contains('is-open')) {
        wrap.classList.remove('is-open');
        link.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
      } else {
        openForm();
      }
    });
    if (wrap.querySelector('.errors, .form_error, [data-error]')) openForm();
  }
  if (document.readyState === 'loading') {
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () { initPasswordToggle(); });
  } else {
    initPasswordToggle();
  }
  document.addEventListener('shopify:section:load', function (e) { initPasswordToggle(e.target); });
})();
